  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/02/IMG_0911.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Este s&aacute;bado, 8 de febrero, ha sido muy taurino, con el toro de la ganader&iacute;a de Roc&iacute;o de la C&aacute;mara de la pe&ntilde;a 50 euros en Tales, y la IV Gala del Bou en el restaurante Palmito de Onda, donde se han entregado los premios de la Pascua Taurina, a los barrios y de la Fira en 2013. Todo en 190 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0677.jpg\" alt=\"img_0677\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0679.jpg\" alt=\"img_0679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0680.jpg\" alt=\"img_0680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0682.jpg\" alt=\"img_0682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0683.jpg\" alt=\"img_0683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0684.jpg\" alt=\"img_0684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0685.jpg\" alt=\"img_0685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalabouonda/img_0686.jpg\" alt=\"img_0686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabte080214talesgalab